## Installation

<InstallCommand pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui" shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/toggle-group.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as ToggleGroup from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/toggle-group";
</script>

<ToggleGroup.Root>
  <ToggleGroup.Item value="bold">Bold</ToggleGroup.Item>
  <ToggleGroup.Item value="italic">Italic</ToggleGroup.Item>
  <ToggleGroup.Item value="underline">Underline</ToggleGroup.Item>
</ToggleGroup.Root>
```

## API Reference

### ToggleGroup.Root

The root owns a `readonly string[]` selection and shares its size, variant, orientation, and disabled
state. Use `defaultValue` for the initial selection or `bind:value` for controlled state. Set
`multiple` to allow more than one pressed item.

### ToggleGroup.Item

Each item needs a unique `value`. Arrow keys, Home, and End move focus within the group.

### ToggleGroup.Separator

The separator follows the group's orientation and preserves the connected outline treatment.

See the [Shards Toggle Group API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/toggle-group) for focus and selection
behavior.

